WEBVTT

00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:06.452
Design boards · the glyph set in motion.

00:00:06.452 --> 00:00:11.284
The same glyphs live inside controls.

00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:17.550
Reduced motion keeps the state change visible.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.435
Shaders respond to the pointer and theme.

00:00:22.435 --> 00:00:26.786
Turn off the shader and keep the layout.

00:00:26.786 --> 00:00:31.272
Compare several kinds of evidence on the chart sheet.

00:00:31.272 --> 00:00:38.140
The chart keeps the same values in both themes.

